   - **`src/main/java/io/reactivex/rxjava4/internal/operators/observable/ObservableReplay.java`** (Refactoring #4)
     - `DisposeConsumer<R>` (1 field: `ObserverResourceWrapper<R> srw`) → record.
     - `ScheduledReplaySupplier<T>` (5 fields) → record (had non-`private final` `eagerTruncate`).
     - `ReplayBufferSupplier<T>` was already a record.

   - **`src/main/java/io/reactivex/rxjava4/internal/operators/flowable/FlowableReplay.java`** (Refactoring #4)
     - `ScheduledReplayBufferSupplier<T>` (5 fields) → record.
     - `ReplayBufferSupplier<T>` was already a record.

   - **`src/main/java/io/reactivex/rxjava4/internal/schedulers/RxThreadFactory.java`** (Refactoring #5 — in progress, not yet committed)
